cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hep-simbench: validation and benchmarking of a fast simulation against its stock simulation"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
authors:
  - family-names: Mina
    given-names: Rob
    affiliation: "University of Virginia"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2241-8566"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RobMina/hep-simbench"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  hep-simbench scores a fast simulation against its stock (full) simulation on the same generated events: histogram validity against a reseeded-stock floor, yields with tolerances and a statistical-power rule, an optional classifier score, peak fits, track agreement and portability ratios, in both float32 and float64; plus throughput per grid slot from a warm-rate timer, an approximation registry with provenance records, and Codabench bundles.
keywords:
  - "fast simulation"
  - "validation"
  - "benchmark"
  - "Codabench"
  - "particle physics"
